      "description": "Chosen run on the compare page: glaze swatch, name, remove control.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\"><span class=\"ds-sw\"></span>Claude Opus 5.5<button class=\"ds-x\" aria-label=\"Remove\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 5 10 10M15 5 5 15\"/></svg></button></span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:36px;padding:0 4px 0 12px;font-family:'Archivo Variable','Archivo',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink,#241a14);background:var(--slip-2,#ecebe6);border:1px solid var(--rule-strong,#b3ab9c);border-radius:2px}.ds-sw{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--series-2,#12876a)}.ds-x{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:28px;height:28px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink-2,#5a4c42);border-radius:2px;cursor:pointer}.ds-x:hover{background:var(--slip-3,#e2e0d8);color:var(--ink,#241a14)}.ds-x:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#1769aa);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Leaderboard Rows with Tier Band",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "leaderboard-row",
      "description": "Signature: tabular rows, score bar with interval whisker, painted band between tiers.",
      "html": "<table class=\"ds-board\"><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Model</th><th>TifinaghBench</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ds-n\">1 <small>=</small></td><td><b>GPT-6.1-Sol</b><br><small>OpenAI</small></td><td><span class=\"ds-score\"><b class=\"ds-n\">29.9</b><small class=\"ds-n\">± 1.0</small></span><svg class=\"ds-bar\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" height=\"20\"><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"var(--rule,#d3cfc4)\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"7\" width=\"29.9\" height=\"6\" fill=\"var(--ramp-3,#94641f)\"/><g stroke=\"var(--mark,#241a14)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"><line x1=\"28.9\" x2=\"30.9\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></g></svg></td></tr><tr class=\"ds-div\"><td colspan=\"3\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><pattern id=\"ds-band\" width=\"24\" height=\"16\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><rect width=\"24\" height=\"16\" fill=\"var(--clay,#9c3a22)\"/><path d=\"M12 2.5 17.5 8 12 13.5 6.5 8Z\" fill=\"var(--slip,#f5f5f2)\"/><path d=\"M12 5.5 14.5 8 12 10.5 9.5 8Z\" fill=\"var(--ramp-2,#ba8636)\"/><path d=\"M0 2.5 3 8 0 13.5ZM24 2.5 21 8l3 5.5Z\" fill=\"var(--ramp-2,#ba8636)\"/></pattern></defs><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"16\" fill=\"url(#ds-band)\"/></svg></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ds-n\">3</td><td><b>Claude Opus 5.5</b><br><small>Anthropic</small></td><td><span class=\"ds-score\"><b class=\"ds-n\">27.3</b><small class=\"ds-n\">± 1.0</small></span><svg class=\"ds-bar\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" height=\"20\"><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"var(--rule,#d3cfc4)\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"7\" width=\"27.3\" height=\"6\" fill=\"var(--ramp-3,#94641f)\"/></svg></td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "css": ".ds-board{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Archivo Variable','Archivo',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#241a14);background:var(--slip,#f5f5f2)}.ds-board th{text-align:left;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 88;color:var(--ink-2,#5a4c42);padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-strong,#b3ab9c)}.ds-board td{padding:14px 16px 14px 0;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule,#d3cfc4)}.ds-board tbody tr:not(.ds-div){transition:background-color 150ms}.ds-board tbody tr:not(.ds-div):hover{background:var(--slip-2,#ecebe6)}.ds-board tr.ds-div td{padding:6px 0;border:0}.ds-board small{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--ink-2,#5a4c42)}.ds-n{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums lining-nums}.ds-score{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;width:4.5rem;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:16px;line-height:1.25}.ds-score b{font-size:1.3125rem;font-weight:600}.ds-score small{font-size:.6875rem;color:var(--ink-3,#75675c)}.ds-bar{display:inline-block;width:60%;vertical-align:middle}"
    },
    {
