      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "heatmap-tile",
      "description": "Score tile filled from the ochre ramp with its paired on-ramp text colour.",
      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:3px\"><div class=\"ds-tile\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"background:var(--ramp-2,#ba8636);color:#241a14\"><b>17.4</b><small>174 / 1000</small></div><div class=\"ds-tile\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"background:var(--ramp-6,#3e280a);color:#fbf7f0\"><b>96.5</b><small>965 / 1000</small></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tile{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-height:64px;min-width:120px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:2px;font-family:'Archivo Variable','Archivo',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums lining-nums}.ds-tile b{font-size:1.3125rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1}.ds-tile small{font-size:.75rem;margin-top:4px}.ds-tile:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#1769aa);outline-offset:2px}"
